#X obj 320 1226 s \$0-say;
#X msg 1100 1196 PASS IF: the other four fade out within about 1.3 s and a1 alone is left -- and it grows BACK to the big 24px layout;
#X obj 1100 1226 s \$0-say;
#X msg 2300 1196 a1 1;
