#X obj 140 1280 del 10000;
#X obj 240 1308 t b b b b;
#X msg 320 1346 === STEP-07-of-18 === MODAL OVER PARAMETERS -- modal recording;
#X obj 320 1376 s \$0-say;
#X msg 1100 1346 PASS IF: recording at mid size and NO parameters at all -- the modal outranks them;
#X obj 1100 1376 s \$0-say;
